<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FAQ - Into The Wild</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
    <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

    <h2>What are the opening times?</h2>
    <p>We are open every day from 9am to 6pm.</p>

    <h2>Is there parking available?</h2>
    <p>Yes, free parking is available on site.</p>

    <h2>Are dogs allowed?</h2>
    <p>No, pets are not permitted inside the park.</p>

    <h2>Is the park accessible for wheelchairs?</h2>
    <p>Yes, all areas of the park are wheelchair accessible.</p>

    <h2>Can I bring my own food?</h2>
    <p>Yes, picnic areas are available throughout the park.</p>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>